  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 720.14 Violations Classified",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 720.14 Violations Classified.\n\n(a) Each of the following shall constitute a treatment technique violation:\n\n(1) Failing to comply with Env-Dw 720.06(a);\n\n(2) Failing to conduct an assessment when and as required by Env-Dw 720.07; and\n\n(3) Failing to correct the sanitary defects found during an assessment required by Env-Dw 720.07 within 30 days of the assessment being completed or within the timeframe established in the assessment report approved by the department pursuant to Env-Dw 720.11(e) or Env-Dw 720.12(c), as applicable.\n\n(b) Failing to submit the completed assessment report as required by Env-Dw 720.10 shall constitute a reporting violation.\n\nSource. #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #14427, eff 11-21-25, EXPIRES 11-21-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
}
